  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oil to 350°F.",
    "In a bowl, whisk the flour, sugar, and Jamaican rum extract.",
    "Add the egg and mix until smooth.",
    "Using a spoon, drop small balls of the dough into the hot oil.",
    "Fry the dough until golden brown, about 2-3 minutes.",
    "Drain the dough on paper towels.",
    "Melt the heavy cream in a saucepan over low heat.",
    "Add the powdered sugar, amaretti cookies, and vanilla extract to the cream.",
    "Stir until the mixture thickens.",
    "Kiss the fried dough with the Jamaican amaretti glaze.",
    "Serve warm and enjoy!"
